SET S TO SHIP.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(350,90).
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:THRUST>590.
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE>5000.
SET T TO 1.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(350,90-0.1*T).
WHEN S:ORBIT:VELOCITY:ORBIT:MAG>4250 THEN LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
UNTIL T>900 {WAIT 0.0285*LN(T).
SET T TO T+1.
IF S:THRUST<1 SET T TO 901.}
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
STAGE.
WAIT 2.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
LOCK STEERING TO HEADING(350,-4.4).
WAIT UNTIL ETA:APOAPSIS<150.
UNLOCK STEERING.
SET S:CONTROL:ROLL TO 1.
WAIT 50.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
WAIT 30.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
SET ROLL TO 0.
WAIT 0.1.
STAGE.
WAIT 0.5.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
WHEN S:OBT:APOAPSIS>360000 THEN LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
WHEN S:OBT:PERIAPSIS>330000 THEN LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
WAIT 200.
STAGE.